  "details": "However I adjusting the value related to Physic Bone, the tail swing worse. \nDynamic bones allow me  swing tail like this.\nhttps://twitter.com/i/status/1500906284883013632\n Adjust Physic Bone for 2 hours, but never succeed ...\nThe tail swing with PB like this.\nhttps://twitter.com/i/status/1500919692214833152\nThe biggest problem I found is that if I swing the tail slowly, it will move slow, and of course, if I swing it quicker , it gets fast.\nBut it's all the same when using PhysicBone, no matter how you treat with the tail, it just move in the same speed.\nThere's no velocity and it's so important. Because this also make some skirt or shirt or anything move worse than dynamic bone.\nAnd about another issue.\nWhy the ears broken?\nEven I delete every collider inside the heads, it still broken like the second video shows.\nHow does this happened?\n\n\nBecause I am so bad in English, if there's something I leave here isn't clear enough, please let me know because I really want PB become better and not to destroy my tail. (Or ear, this shouldn't happened)",
